<mxCell id="may" value="What it may do (you tick it):&#xa;change files; ticked commands,&#xa;exactly as written; 0 to 4&#xa;sub-agents; search; GET to&#xa;ticked hosts; notifications" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=15;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="100" width="290" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="budget" value="Its budget: model steps (15),&#xa;minutes (10), runs a day (24).&#xa;Three failed or over-budget&#xa;runs in a row switch it off" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=15;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="250" width="290" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
